%   &\max_{j \leq n} \E_j \left\{ F^{\Bu, \BS, n}([a, b])\right\}^l = o_{a.s.}\left(v^l\right) = o_{a.s.}\left(n^{-l\alpha / 68}\right),  ~~ \forall l \geq 1, \label{Eq_ESD_u_S_rate}
