\begin{abstract}
        In this article, we establish weighted strong and weak type inequalities for non-commutative square functions associated with the differences of ball averages and martingales over group metric measure spaces. These results generalise the main outcome of \cite{saha-rayweighted}.
\end{abstract}



	\maketitle 
