    belongs to $\mathrm{SL}(\mathcal{I})$ as well. The proof goes analogously, by noting that $\sup\{-f(x): 0\le x\le e\}$ can be rewritten equivalently as $\sup\{f(e-x): 0\le x\le e\}$ or $\sup\{f(x): 0\le x\le e\}$ (we omit further details). 

