 &\ge  \frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^m \mathds{1}\left( \langle X_i,w_j\rangle\in\Omega_{2a})\right)- (a\lambda)^{-2}\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^m (a\lambda)^2\mathds{1}\left(|\mathcal{M}_{\lambda}\left( \langle X_i,w-w_j\rangle\right)|> a\lambda\right). 
