As mentioned in the introduction, if $p\in\{2,3\}$ then the statement holds by work done in \cite{G17, GKNT17, GTT}. 
For this reason we can assume that $p\geq 5$. Let $n=a_0+a_1p^{k_1}+a_2p^{k_2}+\cdots+a_tp^{k_t}$ be the $p$-adic expansion of $n$. 
