\section{Data of Imitation Learning}
\label{sec:data of Imitation Learning}
FlowHFT is an imitation learning framework. Therefore, it is crucial to prepare high-quality learning material.
In this section, we firstly detail how to generate a set of various market scenarios. Secondly, for each individual scenario, we evaluate a pool of candidate experts—including established traditional algorithms and reinforcement learning agents—and designate the one exhibiting the best performance as the "expert" for that context. We use the actions generated by the expert's strategy to create state-action pairs for training FlowHFT.

\subsection{Market Simulation}

