P_i^7,P_i^6,P_i^5,P_i^4)$. It can be verified that for the pair $a_2$ and $a_3$, neither of these paths satisfies no $\{a_2,a_3\}$-restoration. Therefore, the domain $\mathbb{D}^*$ does not satisfy Property P.

