for some $t_{k}\in \overline{\mathbb{D}}$ for $k\in \{1,2,3,4\}$.
\end{lemma}

\section{Main Results}

We now prove the main theorems of this paper.

\begin{theorem}
If $f\in \mathcal{S}^{\ast }$ has the form $\left( \ref{1.1}\right) $. Then 
